# Mocha: keep the trace marker writable for applications.
#
# The modern WebView's sandboxed renderer aborts outright if it cannot
# open /sys/kernel/debug/tracing/trace_marker for writing -- and the
# boot-time chmod the platform's own atrace.rc performs does not stick
# on this device. Re-asserted once the system is up: a belt that heals
# the mode whatever undid it at boot, and cheap enough to owe nobody an
# explanation. Installed to /system/etc/init so it rides a system image
# alone, no ramdisk rebuild needed.

on property:sys.boot_completed=1
    chmod 0222 /sys/kernel/debug/tracing/trace_marker
    chmod 0222 /sys/kernel/tracing/trace_marker
